  "id": "adult-stem-cell",
  "term": "adult stem cell",
  "definition": "An adult stem cell is a stem cell found in mature tissues that can develop into a limited range of specialized cell types, usually within a particular tissue. It is generally considered multipotent rather than able to form all cell types, although some evidence suggests limited plasticity under certain conditions.",
